  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose f is a function satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp; all&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>.&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now solving the given functional equation by taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as&#160;</mtext><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>m</mi></mstyle><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>",
